        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hello, I am trying to find out if the way that I played Reconfigure earlier was legal or not. I had put out a Swift Bot and a Cryo Bot, Swift Bot was incap and Cryo Bot was still alive. In my Power Up phase, I picked up Swift Bot&#39;s card and put down Reconfigure, blowing up Cryo Bot and replacing it with Swift Bot.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I know that I wouldn&#39;t have been able to just pick up Swift Bot and put it back down, but how would that apply to a situation like this? Does the restriction on putting a card back down just apply to the card replacing it, or does it last for the whole turn?&nbsp;</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 9429,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 1,
        "deleted_at": null,
        "user_deleted": false,
        "edit_reason": null,
        "can_view_edit_history": true,
