        "created_at": "2014-08-22T09:56:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The limit applies to the Power Up phase and&nbsp;<span>Reconfigure takes an action to put a bot in play so the bot enters play during G</span><span>o Time, Go Time does not list such a restriction so you're fine.</span></p>",
