        "raw": "<p>The limit applies to the Power Up phase and&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Reconfigure takes an action to put a bot in play so the bot enters play during G</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">o Time, Go Time does not list such a restriction so you&#39;re fine.</span></p>",
